			"Message": "build(Wind): Regenerate minified ESBuild config and Target output artifacts\n\nRebuild all compiled JavaScript artifacts in Target/ directory and minify ESBuild configuration files. The Configuration/ESBuild source files are compressed to single-line minified output, while all Target/ output files (Effect, Bootstrap, FileSystem, Function, Polyfills, Types, Workbench) are regenerated from source.\n\nThis refresh ensures the build artifacts stay synchronized with recent changes to PostHog environment variable configuration and extensionGalleryManifest stub additions. Some TypeScript interface files in Target/Bootstrap/Types/ are emptied as part of the build consolidation.",
